  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "starting money",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "money",
            "value": {
              "calc": "start_money"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "owned_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "owned_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "owned_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "artists start at zero",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "value_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "value_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "value_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "first auctioneer",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "auctioneer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "first_auctioneer"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_over",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "roll the die",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deal_roll",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(die_sides, 1 + int(uniform(0, die_sides)))"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "deal the compositions",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[composition_major, composition_minor, composition_middle][[[0, 1, 2], [0, 2, 1], [1, 0, 2], [1, 2, 0], [2, 0, 1], [2, 1, 0]][deal_roll - 1][you.seat - 1]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[composition_middle, composition_major, composition_minor][[[0, 1, 2], [0, 2, 1], [1, 0, 2], [1, 2, 0], [2, 0, 1], [2, 1, 0]][deal_roll - 1][you.seat - 1]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[composition_minor, composition_middle, composition_major][[[0, 1, 2], [0, 2, 1], [1, 0, 2], [1, 2, 0], [2, 0, 1], [2, 1, 0]][deal_roll - 1][you.seat - 1]]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "your hand",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "money",
        "hand_red",
        "hand_blue",
        "hand_green"
      ],
      "text": "Your private hand and money are below. The other two seats hold the other two compositions (A: Red 4/Blue 2/Green 1, B: Red 1/Blue 4/Green 2, C: Red 2/Blue 1/Green 4), but you do not know which seat holds which."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "round starts",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_over",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "message",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(['red'] if you.hand_red > 0 else []) + (['blue'] if you.hand_blue > 0 else []) + (['green'] if you.hand_green > 0 else [])"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} of {total_rounds} begins. Seat {auctioneer} is the auctioneer."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "choose an artist",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == auctioneer"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "artist"
      },
      "text": "You are the auctioneer. Play one card from your hand: choose an artist you still hold. Season counts now: Red {season_red}, Blue {season_blue}, Green {season_green}. The third card of an artist in a season ends the season and is discarded unsold."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "card played",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auctioneer"
            },
            "key": "hand_red",
            "value": -1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "$artist == 'red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auctioneer"
            },
            "key": "hand_blue",
            "value": -1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "$artist == 'blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auctioneer"
            },
            "key": "hand_green",
            "value": -1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "$artist == 'green'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "season_red",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "$artist == 'red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "season_blue",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "$artist == 'blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "season_green",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "$artist == 'green'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "current_artist",
            "value": "$artist"
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {auctioneer} plays a {current_artist} painting. Season counts: Red {season_red}, Blue {season_blue}, Green {season_green}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "season-ending card",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_over",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "(season_red if current_artist == 'red' else (season_blue if current_artist == 'blue' else season_green)) >= season_end_count"
            },
            "text": "That is the third {current_artist} card this season: it is discarded unsold and the season ends now."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "talk",
      "label": "talk",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 0"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 30
      },
      "store": "message",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} says: {value}"
      },
      "text": "A {current_artist} painting is up for sealed bids. Write one short message to the table; it binds no one."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "sealed bid",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 0"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "min_bid"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.money"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} bid {value} on the {current_artist} painting."
      },
      "text": "Sealed bid on the {current_artist} painting: a whole number from {min_bid} up to your money. Highest bid wins and pays its bid; ties go to the seat after the auctioneer, then the next seat, the auctioneer last. If every bid is 0 the auctioneer takes it for 0."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "find the winner",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "price",
            "value": {
              "calc": "high_bid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "auctioneer if high_bid == 0 else (min([(p.seat - auctioneer - 1) % len(players) for p in players if p.bid == high_bid]) + auctioneer) % len(players) + 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "settle the sale",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner"
            },
            "key": "money",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-price"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner != auctioneer"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auctioneer"
            },
            "key": "money",
            "value": {
              "calc": "price"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner != auctioneer"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "auctioneer"
            },
            "key": "money",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-price"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner == auctioneer and price > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner"
            },
            "key": "owned_red",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "current_artist == 'red'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner"
            },
            "key": "owned_blue",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "current_artist == 'blue'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "winner"
            },
            "key": "owned_green",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "current_artist == 'green'"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {winner} buys the {current_artist} painting for {price} (auctioneer: seat {auctioneer})."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "season",
      "label": "final round flag",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_over",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
            },
            "text": "That was the last round: the final season ends now."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "season",
      "label": "season scoring",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(season_red, season_blue, season_green)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_ties",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(s == top_count for s in [season_red, season_blue, season_green])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "second_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([s for s in [season_red, season_blue, season_green] if s < top_count] + [0])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "second_ties",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(s == second_count for s in [season_red, season_blue, season_green])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "first_place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and season_red == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_red",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and season_red == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "first_place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and season_blue == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_blue",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and season_blue == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "first_place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and season_green == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_green",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and season_green == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "second_place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and second_count >= min_season_count_to_score and second_ties == 1 and season_red == second_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_red",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and second_count >= min_season_count_to_score and second_ties == 1 and season_red == second_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "second_place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and second_count >= min_season_count_to_score and second_ties == 1 and season_blue == second_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_blue",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and second_count >= min_season_count_to_score and second_ties == 1 and season_blue == second_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "second_place_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and second_count >= min_season_count_to_score and second_ties == 1 and season_green == second_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_green",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties == 1 and second_count >= min_season_count_to_score and second_ties == 1 and season_green == second_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_red",
            "value": {
              "calc": "tie_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties >= 2 and season_red == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_red",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties >= 2 and season_red == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_blue",
            "value": {
              "calc": "tie_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties >= 2 and season_blue == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_blue",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties >= 2 and season_blue == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "value_green",
            "value": {
              "calc": "tie_value"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties >= 2 and season_green == top_count"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "scored_green",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "top_count >= min_season_count_to_score and top_ties >= 2 and season_green == top_count"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "season",
      "label": "season payout",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "last_payout",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.owned_red * value_red * scored_red + you.owned_blue * value_blue * scored_blue + you.owned_green * value_green * scored_green"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "money",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.last_payout"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "season",
      "label": "season reset",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "owned_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "owned_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "owned_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_red",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_blue",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "season_green",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "season",
      "label": "season results",
      "when": {
        "calc": "season_over == 1"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Season scored. Scored this season (1 = yes): Red {scored_red}, Blue {scored_blue}, Green {scored_green}. Values now: Red {value_red}, Blue {value_blue}, Green {value_green}. Payouts: Seat 1 {players[0].last_payout}, Seat 2 {players[1].last_payout}, Seat 3 {players[2].last_payout}. Money: Seat 1 {players[0].money}, Seat 2 {players[1].money}, Seat 3 {players[2].money}. Paintings are discarded and season counts reset."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "rotate auctioneer",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "auctioneer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "auctioneer % len(players) + 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.money",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final money: Seat 1 {players[0].money}, Seat 2 {players[1].money}, Seat 3 {players[2].money}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 18,
    "rounds_max": 20,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Three players (seats 1, 2, 3) and three artists: Red, Blue and Green. Everyone starts with {start_money} money and owns no paintings. Every artist starts with season count 0 and value 0. Money is public: every bid, price and payout is announced. Your hand is private.\n\nDeal: a hidden die (1 to {die_sides}) gives each seat one of three compositions of {cards_per_hand} cards: A is Red {composition_major}, Blue {composition_middle}, Green {composition_minor}; B is Red {composition_minor}, Blue {composition_major}, Green {composition_middle}; C is Red {composition_middle}, Blue {composition_minor}, Green {composition_major}. You see only your own hand; the other two seats hold the other two compositions, but you do not know which seat holds which.\n\nThe game lasts {total_rounds} rounds. Seat {first_auctioneer} is the first auctioneer, and the role passes 1 to 2, 2 to 3, 3 to 1 after every round, so each seat is auctioneer {auctions_per_seat} times.\n\nEach round: the auctioneer plays one card from their hand (only an artist they still hold), and that artist's season count rises by 1. If that makes the season count {season_end_count}, the card is discarded unsold, the season ends, and there is no talk, bid or sale that round. Otherwise: every player writes one short message at the same time (shown to all by seat; nothing binds). Then all three players, including the auctioneer, bid at the same moment a whole number from {min_bid} up to their own money; bids are hidden until all are in, then announced. The highest bid wins and the price is that bid. If the highest bid is 0, the auctioneer takes the painting at price 0. A tie at a positive bid goes to the tied seat that comes first in this order: the seat after the auctioneer, then the next seat, with the auctioneer last. If the winner is not the auctioneer, the winner pays the price to the auctioneer; if the winner is the auctioneer, the auctioneer pays the price to the bank. The winner owns one more painting of that artist. In round {total_rounds} the season also ends after the sale.\n\nSeason scoring: only artists with season count at least {min_season_count_to_score} can score. If one artist has the strictly highest season count, its value rises by {first_place_value}; then, if one of the other two has a strictly higher season count than the third and at least {min_season_count_to_score}, its value rises by {second_place_value}, otherwise no second artist scores. If two or three artists tie for the highest season count, each of them gains {tie_value} value and no other artist scores. For each artist that scored, every player receives (paintings of it they own) x (its new cumulative value). Artists that did not score pay nothing but keep their value. Then all paintings are discarded and season counts reset to 0; values are kept. The scoring artists, new values, payouts and money are announced.\n\nAfter round {total_rounds}, including the final season's payout, the player with the most money wins; players tied for the most money share the result (a draw)."
}
